<title>JAPAN: Japan August brass mill output off for 11th month.</title>
<headline>Japan August brass mill output off for 11th month.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's brass mill output fell in August for the 11th consecutive month, sliding 3.0 percent from a year ago to a seasonally adjusted 95,630 tonnes, the Japan Brass Makers Association said on Friday.</p>
<p>July output was revised downward to a seasonally adjusted 96,839 tonnes, a year-on-year decline of 2.9 percent.</p>
<p>Shipments in July rose for the first time in six months, gaining 1.6 percent year-on-year to 103,380 tonnes.</p>
<p>Inventories at the end of July stood at 39,478 tonnes, down from 42,555 tonnes in June. No data was available for August shipments or inventories.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk (81-3 3432 6179)</p>
